.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::OverburdenPressureVisitor< dim >"For a given Sv (overburden stress at the model top), this visitor computes:

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
the (hydraulic) 'conductivity' from the element 'permeability' and (nodal) 'fluid viscosity'
.IP "\(bu" 2
(nodal) 'gravity force' scalar variable as the product of g (specified by user) and the 'dry rock density' specified as element property\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
the (element) 'gravity term' vector variable used in for the integration of the fluid density via the corresponding PDE operator\&.

.PP
\fBTodo\fP
.RS 4
SKM: this visitor should include the influence of pore pressure\&.
.RE
.PP

.PP

